From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:47:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1086/3799] soh: rename func_80A50518 -> EnGuest_WaitForTalk

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: offers talk inside 100 units and switches to the conversation state when the player accepts.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c
index a214cb3fb..11b346971 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c
@@ -17,7 +17,8 @@ void EnGuest_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void EnGuest_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void EnGuest_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
-void func_80A50518(EnGuest* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A50518: offers talk inside 100 units and switches to the conversation state when the player accepts.
+void EnGuest_WaitForTalk(EnGuest* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A50518 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_80A5057C(EnGuest* this, PlayState* play);
